---
/** "Rules beside the phone" for the follow-up call (plan section 5). */
---

<aside class="rules" aria-labelledby="rules-h">
  <h3 id="rules-h">Rules beside the phone</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <b>Opt-in.</b> Only drivers who switch it on get a follow-up.
    </li>
    <li>
      <b>Always says it is AI.</b> The caller always says it is an AI assistant.
    </li>
    <li>
      <b>Never while moving.</b> Never while moving or waiting in traffic.
    </li>
    <li>
      <b>One callback.</b> One callback at most.
    </li>
    <li>
      <b>Three questions.</b> Three questions at most.
    </li>
    <li>
      <b>Questions that fit.</b> Only questions that fit the report type.
    </li>
    <li>
      <b>Not for short-lived reports.</b> No follow-up for police or traffic reports, which expire
      within minutes.
    </li>
  </ul>
</aside>

<style>
  .rules {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 2px dashed var(--sign);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 14px 16px 6px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .rules h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--green-ink);
  }
  .rules ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .rules li {
    padding: 6px 0 6px 26px;
    position: relative;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .rules li:first-child {
    border-top: 0;
  }
  .rules li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 2px;
    top: 0.75em;
    width: 12px;
    height: 7px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--green-ink);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--green-ink);
    transform: rotate(-45deg);
  }
</style>
